AUDIO: 'sheet. This is going to be your three panel character reference sheet that you\'re going to use on all of your video generations for those specific scenes where they\'re wearing that. This is going to be a three panel. You can also do a six panel. The character builder'

[17:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'skill is going to default to a three panel. You\'re going to have a front, headless, full body, rear, and a close-up head shot. The reason being is that when seed dance looks at the reference sheet that you\'re providing,'

[17:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
